  m_text: 'AUTO ATTACK

    Available:

    Hero Level 0

    Maximum Rank:25

    Each
    Rank Bonus: +0.5% Damage& +0.5%Hit Rate

    Maximum Rank Bonuses: +12.5 DPS+0.5
    Hit Rate+12.5 HPS

    SYSTEM CAPS

    Maximum Damage gained from: - Items-
    Bags

    - Hero Level Up- Talents- Skills- Buffs

    Damage Cap:1000%

    After
    reaching this Capacity, the Hero

    will no longer gain additional Damage.

    Maximum
    Hit Rate gained from: - Items- Bags

    - Hero Level Up- Talents- Skills- Buffs

    Hit
    Rate Cap:70%

    After reaching this Capacity, the Hero

    will no longer
    gain additional Hit Rate.

    Higher percentages may still appear

    visually,
    but no extra Hit Rate

    will be applied beyond 70%

'
